    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 19th level, the astrologian has honed her ability to call material from the stars. She can fill an area equal to a 60-ft.-diameter sphere with the void of space within 100 feet, which deals 10d6 points of ice damage and immediately suffocates all creatures within the sphere, a Fortitude save (DC 10 + half of the astrologian's level + her Wisdom modifier) for half damage and staggered for 1 round rather than suffocated. She can use this ability a number of times per day equal to her Wisdom modifier.</p>",
